        "text": "Raymond Jackson was elected to the Hermosa Beach City Council in 2021 and reelected in 2022. He served as mayor in 2023. A retired Army colonel, he served nearly 30 years as a combat medic and Judge Advocate General's Corps officer. He was appointed to the California Coastal Commission in 2025 and serves on the Clean Power Alliance.",
